E287                             ; "[" followed by a letter stores the body"s address in that letter"s cell:
E287                             ; uppercase is a word, lowercase a variable. Followed by a space it pushes
E287                             ; the body"s address instead. Either way it then skips to the matching "]'.
E287                             ; (The unchecked build takes anything that is not a letter as the space; the
E287                             ; checked build stops on it.)
